    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Filtering"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "It’s possible to specify a period of burst usage using:ref:filtering <filtering> by date:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Lower than: ?date__lt=2014-10-21"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Greater than: ?date__gt=2014-10-21"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Example for retrieving burst usage for the whole of July 2014:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "classification": "request-example",
      "kind": "code",
      "method": "GET",
      "original_sha256": "35d9631f2169c5ce65e5216878a6f15ed1a23cb065ab9994c27f6de8c4585adc",
      "path": "/api/2.0/dailyburstusage/?date__gt=2014-07-01&date__lt=2014-08-01"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Note"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "id3",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "The date is full time, which means that 2014-11-11 is 2014-11-11 00:00. This matters when trying to filter because when using less than, it will not include the day, whereas it will be included for greater than."
    }
  ],
